  "name": "elections-official-by-election-results",
  "notes": "The by-election results are used to identify the candidates running, the number of votes each candidate received, which candidate received the most votes, analysis and for statistical purposes. The City Clerk is responsible for declaring the official by-election results.\r\n\r\nThe data set contains the:\r\n\r\n- name of the elected position in which candidates are running\r\n\r\n- names of all candidates running in a City of Toronto municipal by-election by subdivision and ward number\r\n\r\n- official voting results by ward and subdivision.",
